     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, I&#39;m hoping someone will be able to shed light on my mistake as I am experiencing an error in the ectotherm model.  <div><br></div><div>error: minshades must be a vector with a length equal to the number of days simulated <br></div><div><br></div><div>I am unsure of the relationship between the simulated days and the shade quantity. Would someone be able to provide clarification?<br><br>Many thanks. </div><div><br></div><div>Code:</div><div><br></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">library(NicheMapR)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<pre style=\"background:#f7f7f7\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">longlat &lt;- c(145.43, -17.13) # Walkamin research station, northern Australia\r\n</span><code><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">timeinterval&lt;-</span></code><span><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(64,160,112);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">24<br>nyears&lt;-5</span></span><i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#60a0b0\">\r\n</span></i><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">micro &lt;- micro_global(loc = longlat, soiltype = 10, elev = 594, runmoist = 1, timeinterval = timeinterval, runshade = 1, minshade = 0, maxshade = 40, clearsky = 1, run.gads =1, IR = 0, soilgrids = 0, Usrhyt = </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:red\">0.02, slope = 0, aspect = 0, REFL = 0.15</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">)</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:#333333\"><u></u><u></u></span></pre>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#7030a0\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#7030a0\">Ww_g </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&lt;-<span style=\"color:#4070a0\"> </span><span style=\"color:#40a070\">0.80</span> <i><span style=\"color:#60a0b0\"># wet weight of animal (g)- find actual values</span></i></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333;background:#f7f7f7\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:red\">pct_wet\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&lt;-<span style=\"color:#4070a0\"> </span><span style=\"color:#40a070\">0.2</span> <i><span style=\"color:#60a0b0\"># % of surface area acting as a free-water exchanger –\r\namount negligible (find Harris quote)<br>\r\n</span></i><span style=\"color:#7030a0\">alpha_min</span> &lt;-<span style=\"color:#40a070\">0.74</span> <i><span style=\"color:#60a0b0\"># minimum\r\nsolar absorbtivity (dec %) reflectance opposite of absorption </span></i></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333;background:#f7f7f7\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;fo