<span style=\"color:#60a0b0\">#\r\nmin Tb at which leaves retreat to bask</span></i></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333;background:#f7f7f7\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#c45911\">T_F_min </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&lt;-<span style=\"color:#4070a0\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:#40a070\">20</span> <i><span style=\"color:#60a0b0\">#\r\nminimum Tb at which activity occurs</span></i></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333;background:#f7f7f7\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#c45911\">T_F_max </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&lt;-<span style=\"color:#4070a0\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:#40a070\">28</span> <i><span style=\"color:#60a0b0\">#\r\nmaximum Tb at which activity occurs</span></i></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333;background:#f7f7f7\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#c45911\">T_pref </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&lt;-<span style=\"color:#4070a0\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:#40a070\">28</span> <i><span style=\"color:#60a0b0\">#\r\npreferred Tb (will try and regulate to this)</span></i></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333;background:#f7f7f7\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;marg