    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi Alex,</div><div><br></div><div>You can specify the shade values to be different for each day (e.g. if vegetation is changing through time) but the vectors &#39;minshades&#39; and &#39;maxshades&#39; need to be the same length as the number of days you&#39;re simulating. You made &#39;minshades&#39; have length of 10, but instead you should put:</div><div><br></div><div>minshades &lt;- rep(0, length(micro$MAXSHADES)) # min available shade?</div><div><br></div><div>All the best,<br>Mike<br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
